#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "56_The Florist"
msgid "Can't thank you guys enough for helping me out with that\\r\nidiot son of mine."
msgstr "Les estoy sumamente agradecido por echarme una mano\\r\ncon el idiota de mi hijo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Akiyama"
msgid "Just remember, you owe me one."
msgstr "Que no se te olvide que me debes una."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Akiyama"
msgid "I had to get one of my sweet, innocent hostesses to play\\r\nalong with our little charade."
msgstr "Tuve que convencer a una de mis dulces e inocentes chicas, para\\r\nque nos siguiera la corriente en nuestra pequeña actuación."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Tanimura"
msgid "I'm glad to lend a hand, but me, a cheater? Come on."
msgstr "Me alegra poder ayudar, ¿pero yo, un tramposo? ¡Ni hablar!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Tanimura"
msgid "I always play fair and square."
msgstr "Yo siempre juego limpio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Saejima"
msgid "Mhm. And I'm usually the guy who beats up the guys beatin'\\r\non the homeless."
msgstr "Mmm. Y yo generalmente me dedico a combatir la violencia\\r\ncontra los vagabundos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_The Florist"
msgid "Yeah, yeah. I'll make it up to you all, promise."
msgstr "Sí, sí. Les compensaré, lo prometo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh, looks like Takashi's turned out to be a pretty\\r\nresponsible young man, huh?"
msgstr "Je, Parece que Takashi se ha convertido en un joven\\r\nbastante responsable, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Kiryu"
msgid "He never would have made it through all that a few years\\r\nago."
msgstr "Hace unos años, seguro que no habría soportado todo\\r\neso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "164_The Florist"
msgid "True enough."
msgstr "Bastante cierto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Kiryu"
msgid "And if Takashi <Italic>hadn't</Italic> gotten his act together, you wouldn't\\r\nhave taken his request, right?"
msgstr "Y si Takashi no <Italic>hubiera</Italic> cambiado su actitud, no habrías\\r\naccedido a su solicitud, ¿verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_The Florist"
msgid "About that, Kiryu. I have another favor to ask you."
msgstr "Sobre eso, Kiryu. Tengo otro favor que pedirte."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Kiryu"
msgid "Me? What's up?"
msgstr "¿Mm? ¿De qué se trata?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_The Florist"
msgid "I need you to bring this to Takashi."
msgstr "Por favor, necesito que se lo lleves a Takashi."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Kiryu"
msgid "This is..."
msgstr "Esto es..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_The Florist"
msgid "Yeah. The info he wants is on the card in there."
msgstr "Sí. Dentro hay una tarjeta con la información que él quiere."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Kiryu"
msgid "You're not gonna tell him yourself?"
msgstr "¿No se lo vas a decir tú mismo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_The Florist"
msgid "You really think I could bring myself to do that after all\\r\nthese years? I'm an information dealer, Kiryu. Nothing more,\\r\nnothing less."
msgstr "¿En serio piensas que yo haría eso después de todo este\\r\ntiempo? Me dedico a vender información, Kiryu. Ni más\\r\nni menos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Kiryu"
msgid "...If you say so. I'll do it."
msgstr "...Como digas. Lo haré."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_The Florist"
msgid "Appreciated."
msgstr "Te lo encargo."

